      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Retrograde blood flow in menstruating women has been described recently. The acute event seems to be asymptomatic. Reported here is a case of an acute abdominal condition due to cervical obstruction and retrograde bleeding in a postmenopausal patient treated with estrogen-progestogen therapy."},
